1
00:00:00,513 --> 00:00:02,173
That's a Band-Aid at best.

2
00:00:02,349 --> 00:00:05,789
(Sheldon:)The core problem is that Amy and Wil
do not like each other...

3
00:00:05,952 --> 00:00:09,392
(Sheldon:)...which is baffling
because they're both crazy about me.

4
00:00:10,857 --> 00:00:14,187
(Sheldon:)And I like them, which indicates
they're bright and interesting...

5
00:00:14,361 --> 00:00:16,731
(Sheldon:)...and/or were on Star Trek.

6
00:00:17,664 --> 00:00:19,754
(Penny:)Honey, you can't make people
like each other.

7
00:00:20,233 --> 00:00:23,293
(Sheldon:)Not true. Leonard made me like you.

8
00:00:23,470 --> 00:00:25,670
(Sheldon:)Let me tell you, that was a hard row to hoe.

9
00:00:27,207 --> 00:00:29,107
(Sheldon:)Cheers, pal.

10
00:00:30,911 --> 00:00:32,741
Ooh!

11
00:00:33,179 --> 00:00:36,169
(Sheldon:)Boy, that is a treat that's hard to beat.

12
00:00:37,751 --> 00:00:40,811
(Sheldon:)Get the Mad Hatter on the horn.
I'm having a tea party.

13
00:00:46,459 --> 00:00:48,049
You might wanna pace yourself.

14
00:00:48,995 --> 00:00:52,225
(Sheldon:)I drink tea all the time.
I think I know what I'm doing.

15
00:00:53,300 --> 00:00:59,020
Far be it for me
to criticize a man with a full pubis.

